<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Edison raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Edison raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it raised its rating on Boston Edison Co to buy from hold and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our buy recommendation is based on our assumption that Boston Edison's true earnings power and consequently their long-term reported earnings are a lot greater than most investors have given the company credit for,&quot; the brokerage said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 24-7/8.</p>
